
            	<h3><u>Alvida alvida</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><b><u><font size=""4""><p>Alvida alvida</p>
</font></u></b><p><font size=""4"">(Alwidaa Alwidaa Alwidaa Alwidaa) x2</font></p><font size=""4"">
<ol><li>BaBa(a.s.) Kaisay Kahon Alwidaa Alwidaa</li><p>(Alwidaa Alwidaa Alwidaa Alwidaa) x2</p><li>Aap(a.s.) Jatay Nahin Jaan Janay Lagi</li><p>Zindagi Mujh Say Daman Churhanay Lagi</p><p>Saans Seenay Mein Ruk Ruk Kay Aanay Lagi</p><p>Ab Meray Saath Hain Aah Aur Hichkiyaan</p><p>(Alwidaa Alwidaa Alwidaa Alwidaa) x2</p><li>Kio Piyon Main Dawa Hochuki Bas Shifa</li><p>Chorh Kar Mujh Ko Mera Masiha Chala</p><p>Aisa Lagta Hai Mujh Say Hue Tum(a.s.) Khafa</p><p>Meri Hamjoliyaan Ab Hain Tanhaiyaan</p><p>(Alwidaa Alwidaa Alwidaa Alwidaa) x2</p><li>Kaisay Behlaaon Dil Kuch To Bolo Padar(a.s.)</li><p>Qabr Say Kam Nahin Haaey Ab Mera Ghar</p><p>Mot Hai Ab Meri Aap(a.s.) Ka Yeh Safar</p><p>Bolti Hai Nazar Chup Hai Meri Zuban</p><p>(Alwidaa Alwidaa Alwidaa Alwidaa) x2</p><li>Din To Kat Jaeyga Shab Na Kat Paeygi </li><p>Aap(a.s.) Kay Hijr Mein Neend Kab Aaeygi</p><p>Neend Aai To Woh Mot Ban Jaeygi</p><p>Roey Ga Meri Gurbat Peh Ab Aasmaan</p><p>(Alwidaa Alwidaa Alwidaa Alwidaa) x2</p><li>Kon Jaata Hai Beemar Ko Chorh Kar</li><p>Haath Rakhtay Hain Beemar Kis Nabz Par</p><p>Us Ki Dil Joi Kartay Hain Shaam-o-Sahar</p><p>Rakhtay Hain Thanday Paani Ki Bhi Pattiyan</p><p>(Alwidaa Alwidaa Alwidaa Alwidaa) x2</p><li>Lo Meray Ghar Say Rukhsat Ujaala Hua</li><p>Jata Hai Bhai(a.s.) Naazon Ka Paala Hua</p><p>Ranj Is Baat Say Hai Dobala Hua</p><p>Tum(a.s.) Rahogay Wahan Main(s.a.) Rahoongi Yahan</p><p>(Alwidaa Alwidaa Alwidaa Alwidaa) x2</p><li>Haaey BaBa(a.s.) Meray Din Yeh Garmi Kay Hain</li><p>Saath Bachchon Ka Hai Yeh Safar Naa Karein</p><p>Ya To Phir Saath Mujh(s.a.) Ko Bhi Lekay Chalein</p><p>Keh Raha Hai Yehi Ab To Ashk-e-Rawan</p><p>(Alwidaa Alwidaa Alwidaa Alwidaa) x2</p><li>Bhai Akbar(a.s.) Chalay Aur Asghar(a.s.) Chalay</li><p>Mujh Mein Aur Mot Mein Kam Huey Faaslay</p><p>Meri Jaanib Barhhay Dard Kay Qaaflay</p><p>Aakhri Baar Akbar(a.s.) Sunado Azaan</p><p>(Alwidaa Alwidaa Alwidaa Alwidaa) x2</p><li>Kum Say Kum Nanhay Asghar(a.s.) Ko Yaan Chorh Dein</li><p>Saans Ki Toot Ti Doriaan Jorh Dein</p><p>Mot Ka Rukh Meri Simt Say Morh Dein</p><p>Aur Kuch Roz Jeeloongi Main(s.a.) Natawaan</p><p>(Alwidaa Alwidaa Alwidaa Alwidaa) x2</p><li>Aap Ki Ghar Say BaBa(a.s.) Sawari Chali</li></ol>

<p>Dam Karoon Aap Par BaBa(a.s.) Naad-e-Ali(a.s.)</p>
<p>Mein Dua-e-Safar Bhi Karoongi Abhi</p>
<p>Mera Kia Hai Khuda Hai Mera Meharbaan</p>
<p>(Alwidaa Alwidaa Alwidaa Alwidaa) x2</p></font></p>
